---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: Notes from the making of nine turtles, a quiet reader for the open web.
permalink: /blog/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
tags: []
---
<h1>Blog</h1>
<p class="lede">
  Notes from the making of nine turtles: what changed, what we left out, and
  why. A few posts a month at most, never a newsletter.
  <a href="/blog/feed.xml">Follow it by its feed</a>.
</p>
<ol class="posts" reversed>
  {%- for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
  <li>
    <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p class="byline"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time></p>
    <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ol>
